  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Deny Death",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Ultimate Magic pg. 148",
    "definition_raw": "Source Ultimate Magic pg. 148\nYour ki is so strong that it can deny death.\n\nPrerequisites: Ki pool, Endurance.\n\nBenefit: As long as you have 1 ki point in your ki pool, when you fail your Constitution check to stabilize, you do not lose 1 hit point. If you succeed at the check, you can spend 1 ki point to heal 1d6 hit points. If you roll a natural 20 on the check to stabilize, you can spend 1 ki point to heal 2d6 hit points of damage instead.",
